# `frozen-lockfile` is deliberately NOT set here.
#
# Every CI workflow already passes `--frozen-lockfile` explicitly, and pnpm turns it
# on by default whenever CI=true, so forcing it repo-wide protects nothing extra —
# it only breaks the tools that must legitimately rewrite the lockfile. Dependabot
# bumps a version in a package.json and then installs; with the flag pinned on, that
# install dies with ERR_PNPM_OUTDATED_LOCKFILE and every security update is dropped
# before a pull request is ever opened.
